{
 "resource": "misspellings",
 "version": 1,
 "about": "Closed, hand-written misspelling list of SSJ-N04 (class error, FIX/deterministic, OD 3 and lead decision 9.2a item 1) and SSJ-N04c (class colloquial, the 할께 family: LEAVE unless SUPER_SEJONG_FIX_COLLOQUIAL=1, OD 2). pattern is a Python regex applied outside freeze spans; {RIEUL} expands to every Hangul syllable with final ㄹ. replace is a re template. examples are [wrong, fixed] pairs and exclusions are strings that must not match; tests/skills/test_sejong_diagnose.py checks both for every entry. norm cites the article or dictionary entry the correction follows; no dictionary text is copied. New entries need a native-editor review before they are added (T9 D1).",
 "excluded_on_purpose": {
  "뵈요→봬요": "the voice regex of T2 knows 뵈 but not 봬 as a humble form; enabling it would flip humble",
  "설레임→설렘": "collides with a product name",
  "구지→굳이": "collides with place names (구지면, 구지봉)",
  "바램→바람": "빛바램/색 바램 are valid nouns of 바래다; SUGGEST at most, like 바래요 (CTA-BARAE)",
  "않/안 confusion": "needs a clause-level decision (않되/안 돼), not a closed list"
 },
